  "ruleText": "Eng 303.05 Additional References. Applicant’s shall provide the names and addresses of additional references if the original information provided by the reference(s) is unclear, incomplete, or contradictory.\n\nSource. #6911, eff 12-15-98; ss by #8190, eff 10-19-04; ss by #10045, eff 1-1-12, EXPIRED: 1-1-20\n\nNew. #13942, eff 6-25-24",
